OL,3,GNEWSAEducation minister hopeful teacher
OL,4,Astrike can be avoided
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe education minister has said he
OL,7,Fhopes further negotiations with
OL,8,Fteaching unions will avoid strike
OL,9,Faction.
OL,11,FNorthern Ireland's five teaching unions
OL,12,Fvoted for industrial action if the
OL,13,Fdepartment does not address grievances
OL,14,Fover workload.
OL,16,FPaul Givan said he is "fully committed
OL,17,Fto reducing teacher and school leader
OL,18,Fworkload".
